{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52429","headline":"回波乐 七十二 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 七十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不见念佛声，满街闻哭[响]（向）。\n生时同毡被，死则嫌屍妨。\n臭秽不中停，火急须埋葬。\n早死无差科，不愁怕里长。\n行人展脚卧，永绝呼征防。\n生促死路长，久住何益当。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}